    "detailed_description": "Handshakes is a short and sweet puzzler where you must guide two hands towards their goal of a warm, firm handshake.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/2cc861e456e746cc8113311b9bbced0f.poster.avif?t=1730973578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/2cc861e456e746cc8113311b9bbced0f.webm?t=1730973578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/2cc861e456e746cc8113311b9bbced0f.mp4?t=1730973578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Play by yourself, or share your keyboard/controller with a friend and play through 30 puzzles that are designed to stretch your brain, not strain it. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/c977bbf02e45bfe9d258f2a6c38d1d37.poster.avif?t=1730973578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/c977bbf02e45bfe9d258f2a6c38d1d37.webm?t=1730973578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/c977bbf02e45bfe9d258f2a6c38d1d37.mp4?t=1730973578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Handshakes is a short and sweet puzzler where you must guide two hands towards their goal of a warm, firm handshake.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/2cc861e456e746cc8113311b9bbced0f.poster.avif?t=1730973578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/2cc861e456e746cc8113311b9bbced0f.webm?t=1730973578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/2cc861e456e746cc8113311b9bbced0f.mp4?t=1730973578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Play by yourself, or share your keyboard/controller with a friend and play through 30 puzzles that are designed to stretch your brain, not strain it. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/c977bbf02e45bfe9d258f2a6c38d1d37.poster.avif?t=1730973578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/c977bbf02e45bfe9d258f2a6c38d1d37.webm?t=1730973578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2171690/extras/c977bbf02e45bfe9d258f2a6c38d1d37.mp4?t=1730973578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Take your brain for a walk in Handshakes, a simple yet tricksy sokoban puzzle game. Guide two hands through puzzles designed to stump, not frustate, so that they may achieve their dream of a warm, firm handshake.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cHandshakes is embelic of the hidden gems that make up Steam\u2019s gigantic library. Whilst it isn't overflowing with content, it executes a simple concept flawlessly, boasting an adorably endearing art direction and general game flow to boot.\u201d<br>Through a Console, Darkly<br><br>\u201cMost importantly, Handshakes is a strand game. Like Death Stranding, it's about making connections between characters. Death Stranding gamified that by tasking Sam Porter Bridges with hauling deliveries across uneven terrain and building infrastructure. In Handshakes, the yellow fellows are the characters and their bodies are the infrastructure facilitating the connection.\u201d<br>The Gamer<br>",
